<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūcōsus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">succ-</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		sucus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of juice</i> or <i>moisture</i>, <i>juicy</i>, <i>sappy</i>, <i>succulent.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 16, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">resina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 6, 22, § 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					25, 9, 70, § 117</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					25, 13, 102, § 161</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					14, 6, 8, § 68</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lana, i. e. sucida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ser. Samm. 60, 1054</span></i>
			.— <i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">liber (stirpium),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 29, 1</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>rich</i> in money,
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 38, 6</span></i>.</div>
